            <div xml:id="d835">

                <pb facs="0827" n="729" xml:id="pg729"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">836.48 1930 Hurricane/7: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in
                        Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Grummon</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-04T17:00:00-04:00">September 4, 1930—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>100. Please report whether the hurricane has hit any portion of Haiti and if so
                    the extent of the damage.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
